    <node id="越国">
      <data key="d0">越国</data>
      <data key="d1">地点</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity 越国 (Yue State) refers to an ancient Chinese kingdom prominently associated with its ruler, 越王勾践 (King Goujian). It is historically recognized as the state governed by Goujian, whose leadership and strategic acumen are central to its legacy. 越国 is most notable for its prolonged rivalry with 吴国 (Wu State), a relationship defined by deep-seated enmity and warfare. This antagonism is a defining feature of 越国's history, with the two states often depicted as historical adversaries. The struggles between 越国 and 吴国, culminating in 越国's eventual triumph under Goujian's leadership, symbolize resilience, perseverance, and strategic brilliance in Chinese historical narratives.

Several key figures are closely associated with 越国, including 范蠡 (Fan Li), a renowned strategist and advisor, and 文种 (Wen Zhong), another prominent figure in its administration. Both individuals are celebrated for their contributions to the kingdom's governance and military strategies, playing pivotal roles in its success against 吴国. Additionally, 阿青 (A Qing), a lesser-known figure, is mentioned in connection with 越国, further emphasizing the state's historical and cultural significance.

越国 serves as the backdrop for many historical and legendary events, with its struggles against 吴国 forming a central theme. The kingdom's resilience under Goujian's rule and the contributions of figures like Fan Li and Wen Zhong are frequently highlighted in historical accounts, making 越国 a symbol of strategic acumen and perseverance in Chinese history.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-2a72fd2ce03a23a58c65d98d2258f3e1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb8a415d6907f0cafb86835c412854f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76f36e0abe52b904e30fbb2a78b9a4a4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42c3e318eb3b9f5e9c1bd450e13ff5b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8283a4a379ab2b74495b2a64a83b7b40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-939cc8f0980bb7b81255939246f7fe66&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e93cef7b7f368309937f9f274b9ad084&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89960ee186e8b69358a7a5c384a3ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f21edc651357ddf4e1a4ab8e93cf2526&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-170ae9c218e79ffcd211a28e4c5e28c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-202f8c1ca090fa6fcaacd1c6e19d8001&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0218fd37bc9158eb3bd779e577f09de5</data>
