    <edge source="勾践" target="文种">
      <data key="d7">8.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relation between 勾践 (Goujian) and 文种 (Wenzhong) is characterized by a close political and advisory partnership during the governance of the Yue Kingdom. 文种 (Wenzhong) served as a key minister and strategist under 勾践 (Goujian), the ruler of Yue. As a 大夫 (senior official) of the Yue Kingdom, 文种 (Wenzhong) played a pivotal role in assisting 勾践 (Goujian) in the administration and restoration of the state following its struggles against external threats. His contributions as a trusted advisor and counselor were instrumental in shaping the policies and strategies that strengthened the kingdom under 勾践's leadership.</data>
      <data key="d9">师徒,情感,所属</data>
      <data key="d10">chunk-c6f4631a6bc7286dd9560f06b9845d9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f20b87683fe0cc8608a321ff18feb71&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9f3e590b3ab7f94ee3770d3739196401&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b2a680eed881fd86d938031d895d21e</data>
