    <edge source="吴国" target="越国">
      <data key="d7">9.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The relationship between 吴国 (Wu) and 越国 (Yue) is characterized by longstanding hostility and conflict. Historically, the two states were adversaries, engaging in prolonged periods of enmity and warfare. Their relationship is often described as one of deep-seated animosity, with both sides being referred to as "sworn enemies" or "archrivals." This adversarial dynamic defined their interactions, marked by frequent battles and mutual antagonism. The hostility between 吴国 and 越国 was a central feature of their historical relationship, underscoring the intensity and persistence of their rivalry.</data>
      <data key="d9">敌对</data>
